{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"80780","name":"Pantheon","description":"Housed in an elegant 18th century building on a quiet pedestrian street, this hotel is in the centre of Rome, a short walk from the Pantheon, the Trevi Fountain and Piazza Navona. The interior of this small but luxurious Roman hotel has been embellished with special, unique accents. The airport can be reached within a 30-minute drive. Guests are able to have a delicious breakfast in the property and then go out to explore the various shopping and entertaining options the city offers. The rooms follow the elegant décor with soothing colours and wooden furniture. They are also equipped with all the needed amenities for a comfortable and pleasant stay.","address":"Via Dei Pastini, 131","city":"ROME","countryCode":"IT","postalCode":"00186","lat":41.899378,"lng":12.477541,"stars":4,"giataCode":"18643","phone":"+39067264331","email":"info@hotelpantheon.com","website":"http://www.hotelpantheon.com/","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/080780/080780a_hb_a_005_20251223_144459.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/080780/080780a_hb_a_007_20251223_144604.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/080780/080780a_hb_a_008_20251223_144606.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/080780/080780a_hb_a_009_20251223_144607.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/080780/080780a_hb_a_012_20251223_144613.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/080780/080780a_hb_a_014_20251223_144617.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/080780/080780a_hb_a_015_20251223_144619.jpg","category":"exterior","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/080780/080780a_hb_a_017_2025122